X: 1
T: Just As I Am Without One Plea
C: Words: Charlotte Elliott, 1835. Music: 'Woodworth'  William B. Bradbury, 1849.
C: Setting: "The New Hymnal (Episcopal)", 1916.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "The New Hymnal (Episcopal)", 1916 Hymn 139 (second tune)
S: transposed down on half step into the more modernly used key of D
M: 6/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
